message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata. It has not been
  released yet; the release version, date, licence and DOI will be added at release.
type: software
title: "persona-bench (working title): scoring persona chat models with a local LLM judge against a configurable rubric"
abstract: >-
  A harness that sends prompts to a local model under persona system prompts, has a
  second local model score each reply against a configurable rubric, collapsing any
  violation of the judge's output contract to zero, and writes schema-validated reports
  that can be summarised and compared across runs. Extracted with its development
  history from a private application; the underlying development took place privately
  on 27 April 2026.
authors:
